  "description": "<p>This custom anchor doormat brings a unique nautical flair to any boat, dock, or marine setting. Designed for personalization, it allows you to add your boat name, family name, or location, making it a distinctive welcome mat. It combines vibrant maritime colors and anchor designs to enhance the aesthetic of any yacht, fishing boat, or dockside area.</p><h3>Product Highlights</h3><ul>\n<li>Personalize with boat name, family name, or location</li>\n<li>Features vibrant maritime colors and anchor designs</li>\n<li>Crafted from high-quality polyester and soft memory sponge</li>\n<li>Includes anti-slip pads for secure placement</li>\n<li>Easy to clean and maintain with simple methods</li>\n<li>Suitable for high-traffic boat decks and marina entries</li>\n</ul><h3>Specifications</h3><table border=\"1\" cellpadding=\"6\" style=\"border-collapse:collapse;width:100%\">\n<tr>\n<th align=\"left\" width=\"35%\">Attribute</th>\n<th align=\"left\">Value</th>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Rug Form</td>\n<td>Doormat</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Item Shape</td>\n<td>Rectangular</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Weave Type</td>\n<td>Flat Woven</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Pile Height</td>\n<td>Low Pile</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Construction Type</td>\n<td>Machine Made</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Indoor/Outdoor Usage</td>\n<td>Both</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Water Resistance</td>\n<td>Water Repellent</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Pattern</td>\n<td>Anchor</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Theme</td>\n<td>Nautical</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Style</td>\n<td>Nautical</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Number of Pieces</td>\n<td>1</td>\n</tr>\n</table><h3>Material &amp; Care</h3><table border=\"1\" cellpadding=\"6\" style=\"border-collapse:collapse;width:100%\">\n<tr>\n<th align=\"left\" width=\"35%\">Item</th>\n<th align=\"left\">Detail</th>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Material Type</td>\n<td>Polyester, Memory Sponge</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Backing Material</td>\n<td>Polyester</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Care Instructions</td>\n<td>Spot Clean Only</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Cleaning Method</td>\n<td>Shake outdoors, vacuum, wipe clean with damp cloth</td>\n</tr>\n</table><h3>Where It Works</h3><p>This versatile doormat is ideal for cabins, ships, docks, yachts, fishing boats, and marina entries. It is suitable for both indoor and outdoor use, making it perfect for coastal homes and marine environments.</p>",
